sgreenshippingmoreexpensive" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-isgreenshippingmoreexpensive" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="isgreenshippingmoreexpensive-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->No. All of our green delivery options start at the low price £2.62 per parcel when delivered to a ParcelShop. That means your business can reap all of our eco-conscious benefits without any extra costs.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="doesgreenshippingtakelongertoarrive-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-doesgreenshippingtakelongertoarrive" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-doesgreenshippingtakelongertoarrive" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Does green shipping take longer to arrive?-open answer" data-test-id="doesgreenshippingtakelongertoarrive-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="doesgreenshippingtakelongertoarrive-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Does green shipping take longer to arrive?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-doesgreenshippingtakelongertoarrive" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-doesgreenshippingtakelongertoarrive" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="doesgreenshippingtakelongertoarrive-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Absolutely not. No matter how our Couriers deliver your package, they’ll aim to get it to you within your estimated delivery time.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="howdoistartshippingdomesticallywithevri-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-howdoistartshippingdomesticallywithevri" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-howdoistartshippingdomesticallywithevri" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-How do I start shipping domestically with Evri?-open answer" data-test-id="howdoistartshippingdomesticallywithevri-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="howdoistartshippingdomesticallywithevri-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>How do I start shipping domestically with Evri?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-howdoistartshippingdomesticallywithevri" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-howdoistartshippingdomesticallywithevri" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="howdoistartshippingdomesticallywithevri-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Whether you are a side hustle or a full-time business, your products need to get from A to B. Domestic shipping is an essential part of this process. Read our guide on sending parcels domestically to get started.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><!--]--></div></section><!--]--></div></div></div><!--]--></main></div></div><div id="teleports"></div><script>window.__NUXT__={};window.__NUXT__.config={public:{ENV_NAME:"prod",PUBLIC_PATH:"https://www.evri.com",WEB_BASE:"https://www.evri.com/",PRISMIC_REPO:"ev-mercury",DEVTOOLS:false,API_BASE:"https://api.hermesworld.co.uk/",AUTH0_USERS_ENDPOINT:"https://hermes-df-prod.eu.auth0.com/userinfo",AUTH0_CLIENT_ID:"dC8K22keYtRszHe7dnmlWSve2kP7mUBF",AUTH0_DOMAIN:"hermes-df-prod.eu.auth0.com",AUTH0_LOGIN_REDIRECT:"https://www.evri.com/",AUTH0_LOGOUT_REDIRECT:"https://www.evri.com/",ASSETLINKS_PATH:"assetlinks-prod.json",APPLE_MERCHANT_DOMAIN_PATH:"apple-developer-merchantid-domain-association-PROD.txt",APPLE_APP_SITE_ASSOCIATION_PATH:"apple-app-site-association-PROD",CHATBOT_URL:"https://chat-loader.smartagent.app/loader/main.js",FEATURE_SWITCH_URL:"https://www.evri.com/feature-switches/feature-switches.json",FINDER_URL:"https://location-finder.evri.c